## Areas we serve

Newport city centre, Cwmbran, Caerleon, Chepstow, Pontypool, Abergavenny, and across Gwent. We also cover [Cardiff](/web-design-cardiff/), [Bridgend](/web-design-bridgend/), [Caerphilly](/web-design-caerphilly/), and all of [South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/).

## Frequently asked questions

**Do you only work with Newport businesses?**

No. We work with businesses across [South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/) and the UK — Newport is one of our core areas alongside [Cardiff](/web-design-cardiff/) and [Swansea](/web-design-swansea/).

**Can you help improve my Google rankings?**

Yes. Every website we build is SEO-ready from day one. We also offer dedicated [local SEO for Newport businesses](/seo-newport/) for those who want to go further.

**How long does a website take?**

Most projects are completed within 7–14 days depending on scope and how quickly we receive content from you.

**Will my website work on mobile?**

Yes. Every website we build uses mobile-first design — perfect on phones, tablets, and desktops.

**Can I update the site myself?**

Yes. We provide full access and training as part of every project.

